  m_Name: ButtonClicker
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  projectName: ButtonClicker
  description: "ITU Project\nA critical design project exploring the redundancy baked
    into modern interfaces and voice assistants. Rather than solving problems, systems
    like Google Assistant often just defer them \u2014 so we built a marble track
    box that literally does exactly that: push a button through an increasingly elaborate
    chain, until something else pushes it for you.\n\nI contributed with the physical
    build as well as the Arduino programming.\n\nI would have liked to include some
    music, specifically Powerhouse by Raymond Scott, made popular by The Simpsons
    during elborate and comedic factory scenes. It was scoped out, due to the slightly
    cumbersome nature of Arduino and audio integration."
